rīra","author":"Śrīla Narottam Dās Ṭhākur"},"title":["‘Gaurāṅga’ bolite habe"],"author":["by Śrīla Narottam Dās Ṭhākur"],"verses":[{"number":"1","text":["‘gaurāṅga’ bolite hobe pulaka-śorīra","‘hari hari’ bolite nayane ba’be nīra"],"translation":["When will there be shivering of the body upon chanting Lord Gaurāṅga’s Holy Name? When will there be tears in my eyes while chanting the Lord’s Holy Name?"],"isLong":false},{"number":"2","text":["āra kabe nitāi-chā̐da karuṇā koribe","saṁsāra-vāsanā more kabe tucha ha’be"],"translation":["When will I obtain the mercy of Lord Nītyānanda? When, by His mercy, will my desire for material enjoyment become insignificant?"],"isLong":false},{"number":"3","text":["biṣoya chāḍiyā kabe śuddha ha’be mana","kabe hāma herabo śrī-vṛndāvana"],"translation":["When will my mind be completely purified, having given up all material desires? When will I attain the vision of Śrī Vṛndāvan Dhām?"],"isLong":false},{"number":"4","text":["rūpa-raghunātha-pade hoibe ākuti","kabe hāma bujhabo se jugala-pirīti"],"translation":["When will I be eager to follow in the footsteps of Śrī Rūpa and Śrī Raghunāth, and when will I properly understand the loving affairs of the divine couple?"],"isLong":false},{"number":"5","text":["rūpa-raghunātha-pade rahu mora āśa","prārthanā karaye sadā narottama-dāsa"],"translation":["My only aspiration is to attain the lotus feet of Śrī Rūpa and Śrī Raghunāth. Narottam Dās continually submits this prayer."],"isLong":false}],"resources":{"audio":[{"title":"Manasa Krishna Prabhu","embed_url":"https://soundcloud.com/huron/gauranga-bolite-hobe","personSlug":"manasa-krishna-prabhu"},{"title":"Caracas temple","embed_url":"https://soundcloud.com/bharatimaharaj/shchsm-karakas-gauranga-bolite","personSlug":"caracas-temple"}]},"hasWbw":false,"hasVersesText":true,"hasVersesTranslations":true,"hasLongVerses":false,"fullInlineWbw":false},"telegraphUrl":null},"head":{"canonical":"/en-2022/gauranga-bolite-hobe-pulaka-shorira/","description":"‘Gaurāṅga’ bolite habe — a Vaiṣṇava song by Śrīla Narottam Dās Ṭhākur with lyrics, English translation and word-by-word meaning. From Kirtan Guide.","title":"‘Gaurāṅga’ bolite habe. by Śrīla Narottam Dās Ṭhākur | Kirtan Site"},"kind":"song","route":{"kind":"item","bookId":"en-2022","slug":"gauranga-bolite-hobe-pulaka-shorira"}}